#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s already had a line here but are outside this batch's scope, so it could NOT be refreshed and the old figure stands: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s لهم بند هنا مسبقا لكنهم خارج نطاق هذه الدفعة، لذا تعذر تحديثه ويبقى الرقم القديم: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s already had a line in this batch and were left unchanged: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s لديهم سطر في هذه الدفعة أصلًا وتُركوا دون تغيير: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s already have every day of the month in a sub-batch, so nothing was left to import: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s لديهم كل أيام الشهر في دفعة فرعية، فلم يبقَ شيء للاستيراد: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s came back from vacation during the month; only their loads from the return date onwards were counted: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s عادوا من الإجازة خلال الشهر؛ ولم تحتسب إلا حمولاتهم من تاريخ المباشرة فصاعدا: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s had cash loads re-rated from the amount bands instead of the till's own rate — see Not Imported for the figures: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s أعيد تقييم حمولاتهم النقدية وفق شرائح المبالغ بدلا من سعر الصندوق نفسه — راجع غير المستورد للأرقام: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s had loads in BAS with NO «رد الفاتورة» on any of them and were skipped — BAS has not been writing that column since 6 Sep 2026: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s لديهم ردود في BAS دون «رد الفاتورة» في أي منها وتم استبعادهم — لم يعد BAS يكتب ذلك العمود منذ 6 سبتمبر 2026: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s had no trips in BAS this month: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s بلا ردود في BAS هذا الشهر: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s had some loads with no «رد الفاتورة»; those loads are not counted in the weighted quantity: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s لديهم بعض الردود دون «رد الفاتورة»؛ ولا تحتسب تلك الردود في الكمية المرجحة: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s have no BAS cost centre set: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s بلا مركز تكلفة في BAS: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s have no attendance recorded for this month, so the FULL required trips were applied — check their sheet before approving: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s ليس لهم حضور مسجل لهذا الشهر، لذا طبقت الرحلات المطلوبة كاملة — راجع كشوفهم قبل الاعتماد: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s were on vacation this month and were skipped — their trips were settled on the leave request: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s كانوا في إجازة هذا الشهر وتم استبعادهم — سويت رحلاتهم في طلب الإجازة: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
" A line from an earlier import is still on this batch and will not be paid —"
" delete it."
msgstr " لا يزال بند من استيراد سابق في هذه الدفعة ولن يدفع — احذفه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
" Back from vacation on %(date)s — only loads from that date onwards are "
"counted; the earlier part of the month was settled on the leave."
msgstr ""
" باشر العمل بعد الإجازة في %(date)s — لا تحتسب إلا الحمولات من ذلك التاريخ "
"فصاعدا؛ وسوي الجزء الأول من الشهر في الإجازة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid " Covers %(start)s to %(end)s only."
msgstr " يغطي من %(start)s إلى %(end)s فقط."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
" Only %(counted)d of %(new)d load(s) invoiced from %(cut)s are weighted; the"
" other %(missing)d carry no «رد الفاتورة» in BAS."
msgstr ""
" تم ترجيح %(counted)d فقط من %(new)d رد مفوتر من %(cut)s؛ وال %(missing)d "
"الأخرى لا تحمل «رد الفاتورة» في BAS."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid " and %(more)s more"
msgstr " و%(more)s غيرهم"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid ""
"%(component)s already has %(entries)s pay entries and %(recurring)s recurring entries recorded under its current calculation method, so the method cannot be changed: those records would be re-read in the new meaning and their amounts would change.\n"
"\n"
"Create a new component with the calculation you want and archive this one. Its rate can still be changed — that only affects entries still in draft."
msgstr ""
"لدى %(component)s %(entries)s إدخال مستحقات و%(recurring)s إدخال متكرّر مسجّلة بطريقة الاحتساب الحالية، لذا لا يمكن تغيير طريقة الاحتساب: ستُقرأ هذه السجلات بالمعنى الجديد وستتغيّر مبالغها.\n"
"\n"
"أنشئ مكوّناً جديداً بطريقة الاحتساب المطلوبة وأرشف هذا المكوّن. لا يزال بالإمكان تغيير السعر — ويؤثر ذلك فقط على الإدخالات التي ما زالت مسودة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(component)s is imported and reviewed, not typed — %(what)s is not possible"
" here. Press Import to refresh the figures. If one of them is still wrong, "
"the cause is in the source data and not in this batch: contact technical "
"support."
msgstr ""
"%(component)s يستورد ويراجع، ولا يكتب يدويا — %(what)s غير ممكن هنا. اضغط "
"استيراد لتحديث الأرقام. إذا بقي أحدها خاطئا، فالسبب في البيانات المصدر وليس "
"في هذه الدفعة: تواصل مع الدعم الفني."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(component)s is paid for %(occasion)s, but Time Off → Configuration → Public Holidays has no %(occasion)s in %(month)s.\n"
"\n"
"Check that the batch is for the right month. If it is, ask HR to add the holiday there and set its Pay Occasion to %(occasion)s."
msgstr ""
"يدفع %(component)s عن %(occasion)s، لكن الإجازات ← الإعدادات ← العطل الرسمية لا تحتوي على %(occasion)s في %(month)s.\n"
"\n"
"تحقق من أن الدفعة للشهر الصحيح. إذا كانت كذلك، اطلب من الموارد البشرية إضافة العطلة هناك وتحديد مناسبة الدفع لها إلى %(occasion)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"%(count)s entr%(plural)s worth %(amount).2f will NOT be paid: %(who)s went "
"on vacation, and what they had earned was settled on the leave request "
"itself. Release the month under Vacation Releases if it was never listed "
"there."
msgstr ""
"%(count)s إدخالا بقيمة %(amount).2f لن تدفع: %(who)s ذهب في إجازة، وما "
"استحقه سوي في طلب الإجازة نفسه. حرر الشهر من إفراجات الإجازة إذا لم يدرج "
"هناك قط."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(count)s recurring entr%(plural)s added."
msgstr "تمت إضافة %(count)s إدخال متكرّر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(date)s is outside the batch period %(period)s."
msgstr "التاريخ %(date)s خارج فترة الدفعة %(period)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"%(emp)s changed after the bank file was exported on %(when)s. Export the "
"bank file again before sending it."
msgstr ""
"تغير %(emp)s بعد تصدير ملف البنك في %(when)s. صدر ملف البنك مرة أخرى قبل "
"إرساله."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_employee_rate.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s already has a rate for %(what)s starting %(start)s, and the two"
" periods overlap. Close that one off first — two rates for the same day is a"
" question with two answers."
msgstr ""
"لدى %(employee)s سعر ل %(what)s يبدأ في %(start)s بالفعل، والفترتان "
"متداخلتان. أغلق ذلك السعر أولا — سعران لليوم نفسه سؤال له جوابان."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s already has a recurring %(what)s for '%(reason)s' starting on "
"that date. Give this one a different reason if it is a separate payment."
msgstr ""
"لدى %(employee)s %(what)s متكرر ل '%(reason)s' يبدأ في ذلك التاريخ بالفعل. "
"أعط هذا سببا مختلفا إذا كان دفعة منفصلة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid "%(employee)s already has a recurring %(what)s starting on that date."
msgstr "لدى %(employee)s بالفعل %(what)s متكرّر يبدأ في ذلك التاريخ."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_vacation_hold.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s came back on %(return_date)s. Only %(count)s Friday(s) of %(month)s fall on or after that day, and this entry claims %(qty)s.\n"
"\n"
"The Fridays before his return were settled on his vacation request. %(what)s is therefore not possible."
msgstr ""
"باشر %(employee)s العمل في %(return_date)s. يقع %(count)s يوم جمعة فقط من %(month)s في ذلك اليوم أو بعده، بينما يطالب هذا الإدخال ب %(qty)s.\n"
"\n"
"أيام الجمعة قبل مباشرته سويت في طلب إجازته. لذا فإن %(what)s غير ممكن."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s does not report to you and is not in a department you manage, "
"so you cannot set up recurring pay for them."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s لا يتبعك إداريًا وليس ضمن قسم تديره، لذا لا يمكنك إعداد مستحقات"
" متكرّرة له."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s is not in %(scope)s and does not report to you, so you cannot "
"record pay for them."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s ليس ضمن %(scope)s ولا يتبعك إداريًا، لذا لا يمكنك تسجيل مستحقات"
" له."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_vacation_release.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s is not in a department you are the General Manager of, so "
"releasing his month is not yours to do."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s ليس في إدارة أنت مديرها العام، لذا فإن الإفراج عن شهره ليس من "
"صلاحيتك."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_vacation_hold.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s was on %(type)s until %(last_day)s and came back on %(return_date)s.\n"
"\n"
"Everything up to the day he left was settled on that request, so only what he did from %(return_date)s onwards is payable in %(month)s — and this entry is dated %(date)s.\n"
"\n"
"%(what)s is therefore not possible."
msgstr ""
"كان %(employee)s في %(type)s حتى %(last_day)s وباشر العمل في %(return_date)s.\n"
"\n"
"سوي كل شيء حتى يوم مغادرته في ذلك الطلب، لذا لا يستحق في %(month)s إلا ما عمله من %(return_date)s فصاعدا — وهذا الإدخال مؤرخ في %(date)s.\n"
"\n"
"لذا فإن %(what)s غير ممكن."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_vacation_hold.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s went on %(type)s on %(start)s — after %(month)s had ended, but before %(month)s was ever paid.\n"
"\n"
"Everything still owed to him that day was settled on the request itself, and %(month)s was one of those months: Accounting lists them on the leave and they go out with the vacation payslip. So it has already been paid.\n"
"\n"
"%(what)s is therefore not possible.\n"
"\n"
"If %(month)s was in fact never listed on the leave, the General Manager can release it — Commissions → Vacation Releases — and it becomes payable again."
msgstr ""
"ذهب %(employee)s في %(type)s في %(start)s — بعد انتهاء %(month)s، لكن قبل دفع %(month)s.\n"
"\n"
"كل ما كان مستحقا له في ذلك اليوم سوي في الطلب نفسه، و%(month)s من تلك الأشهر: تدرجها المحاسبة في الإجازة وتصرف مع كشف راتب الإجازة. لذا فقد دفع بالفعل.\n"
"\n"
"لذا فإن %(what)s غير ممكن.\n"
"\n"
"إذا لم يدرج %(month)s في الإجازة فعلا، يمكن للمدير العام الإفراج عنه — العمولات ← إفراجات الإجازة — فيصبح مستحق الدفع مجددا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_vacation_hold.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s went on %(type)s on %(start)s.\n"
"\n"
"Everything he had earned up to that day was settled on the request itself: Accounting lists the commission months still owed on the leave and they are paid out with the vacation payslip. So %(month)s has already been paid and is not payable again here.\n"
"\n"
"%(what)s is therefore not possible.\n"
"\n"
"If that month was in fact never listed on the leave, the General Manager can release it — Commissions → Vacation Releases — and it becomes payable again."
msgstr ""
"ذهب %(employee)s في %(type)s في %(start)s.\n"
"\n"
"كل ما استحقه حتى ذلك اليوم سوي في الطلب نفسه: تدرج المحاسبة أشهر العمولات المستحقة في الإجازة وتصرف مع كشف راتب الإجازة. لذا فقد دفع %(month)s بالفعل ولا يستحق مرة أخرى هنا.\n"
"\n"
"لذا فإن %(what)s غير ممكن.\n"
"\n"
"إذا لم يدرج ذلك الشهر في الإجازة فعلا، يمكن للمدير العام الإفراج عنه — العمولات ← إفراجات الإجازة — فيصبح مستحق الدفع مجددا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(entry)s (%(month)s) has been paid, so it cannot be reopened — not even by "
"the General Manager."
msgstr ""
"تم صرف %(entry)s (%(month)s)، فلا يمكن إعادة فتحه — ولا حتى من المدير العام."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(entry)s (%(month)s) was paid on the vacation payslip %(slip)s. %(what)s is"
" not possible. If that payslip was wrong, cancel or recompute it from the "
"leave request first."
msgstr ""
"صُرف %(entry)s (%(month)s) في كشف راتب الإجازة %(slip)s، لذا لا يمكن "
"%(what)s. إذا كان كشف الراتب ذلك خاطئًا، فألغِه أو أعد احتسابه من طلب "
"الإجازة أولًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(entry)s has been approved by the General Manager and cannot be deleted."
msgstr "اعتمد المدير العام %(entry)s ولا يمكن حذفه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(entry)s is %(state)s — it is with the General Manager or already approved."
" %(what)s is not possible; ask him to return it."
msgstr ""
"%(entry)s حالته %(state)s — لدى المدير العام أو معتمد. لا يمكن %(what)s؛ "
"اطلب منه إعادته."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(entry)s is already included in the vacation settlement of %(leave)s. "
"Return that request to Accounting and refresh its commissions without it "
"before reopening this row."
msgstr ""
"%(entry)s مُدرج بالفعل في تسوية إجازة %(leave)s. أعد ذلك الطلب إلى المحاسبة "
"وحدّث عمولاته بدونه قبل إعادة فتح هذا السطر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(existing)s already covers %(component)s for this scope and month."
msgstr "تغطّي %(existing)s بالفعل %(component)s لهذا النطاق وهذا الشهر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(label)s must be greater than zero. To remove a line, press Discard, then "
"delete it with the bin icon at the end of its row."
msgstr ""
"يجب أن يكون %(label)s أكبر من صفر. لحذف سطر، اضغط «تجاهل» ثم احذفه بأيقونة "
"سلة المهملات في نهاية السطر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_deduction.py:0
msgid ""
"%(left).2f is still owed: the next payslip or the next approved commission "
"month collects it, whichever comes first."
msgstr ""
"لا يزال %(left).2f مستحقا: يحصله كشف الراتب التالي أو شهر العمولة المعتمد "
"التالي، أيهما أسبق."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "%(matched)s driver(s) filled from BAS."
msgstr "تم تعبئة %(matched)s سائق من BAS."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"%(missing)d of the %(new)d load(s) invoiced on or after %(cut)s carry no «رد"
" الفاتورة», so they are not counted in the weighted quantity below. Check "
"the figure before approving."
msgstr ""
"%(missing)d من %(new)d رد مفوتر في %(cut)s أو بعده لا تحمل «رد الفاتورة»، "
"لذا لا تحتسب في الكمية المرجحة أدناه. راجع الرقم قبل الاعتماد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(month)s has already been finalised. %(what)s is no longer possible — the "
"month has to be reopened first."
msgstr ""
"تم إقفال %(month)s. لم يعد %(what)s ممكنًا — يجب إعادة فتح الشهر أولًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/wizard/ksw_pay_handover_wizards.py:0
msgid "%(month)s has already been finalised. Reopen the month first."
msgstr "تم إقفال %(month)s. أعد فتح الشهر أولًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(month)s has been finalised. Reopen the month first — a batch cannot be "
"reopened inside a finalised month."
msgstr ""
"تم إقفال %(month)s. أعد فتح الشهر أولًا — لا يمكن إعادة فتح دفعة داخل شهر "
"مُقفل."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"%(n)d load(s) went to cash customers. BAS books those to the till, whose own"
" rate would weight them %(till).2f; the amount bands weight them %(band).2f "
"— a difference of %(d)+.2f on this driver."
msgstr ""
"%(n)d حمولة ذهبت إلى عملاء نقديين. يسجلها BAS على الصندوق، الذي يرجحها سعره "
"ب %(till).2f؛ بينما ترجحها شرائح المبالغ ب %(band).2f — بفرق %(d)+.2f على "
"هذا السائق."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s cannot be deleted: %(count)s of its entries have been handed to or "
"approved by the General Manager."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن حذف %(name)s: عدد %(count)s من قيودها سُلِّم إلى المدير العام أو "
"اعتمده."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s cannot be submitted: %(count)s entr%(plural)s belong%(verb)s to somebody whose %(period)s was already settled on his vacation request.\n"
"\n"
"%(who)s\n"
"\n"
"Delete those entries, or ask the General Manager to release the month (Commissions → Vacation Releases)."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن تقديم %(name)s: %(count)s إدخالا تخص شخصا سويت %(period)s الخاصة به في طلب إجازته.\n"
"\n"
"%(who)s\n"
"\n"
"احذف تلك الإدخالات، أو اطلب من المدير العام الإفراج عن الشهر (العمولات ← إفراجات الإجازة)."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has already been approved."
msgstr "سبق اعتماد %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/wizard/ksw_pay_handover_wizards.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s has already been submitted, so nobody can be added to it. Start a "
"new sub-batch with its own days and reason."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s قُدّمت بالفعل، فلا يمكن إضافة أحد إليها. ابدأ دفعة فرعية جديدة "
"بأيامها وسببها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has already been submitted."
msgstr "سبق تقديم %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has been approved and can no longer be changed."
msgstr "اعتُمد %(name)s ولم يعد قابلًا للتعديل."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has been approved. Only the General Manager can reopen it."
msgstr "اعتُمدت %(name)s. ولا يمكن إعادة فتحها إلا للمدير العام."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s has been approved. Only the General Manager can reopen the month."
msgstr "اعتُمد %(name)s. ولا يمكن إعادة فتح الشهر إلا للمدير العام."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has been approved. Reopen it before changing it."
msgstr "اعتُمدت %(name)s. أعِد فتحها قبل تعديلها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has been handed to the General Manager and cannot be deleted."
msgstr "سُلِّمت %(name)s إلى المدير العام ولا يمكن حذفها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s has been paid. A paid month cannot be reopened — not even by the "
"General Manager."
msgstr ""
"تم صرف %(name)s. لا يمكن إعادة فتح شهر مصروف — ولا حتى من المدير العام."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s has been submitted. %(what)s is only possible while it is in Draft."
msgstr "تم تقديم %(name)s. %(what)s ممكن فقط ما دام في حالة مسودة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has no import source configured."
msgstr "لا يوجد مصدر استيراد مُهيَّأ لـ %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s has no imported component — correct its rows in their batches."
msgstr "لا يوجد في %(name)s نوع مستحق مستورد — صحّح سطورها في دفعاتها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has not been submitted yet, so there is nothing to approve."
msgstr "لم يُقدَّم %(name)s بعد، فلا يوجد ما يُعتمَد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s has nothing to submit: none of its employees has a draft entry in "
"%(scope)s."
msgstr ""
"لا يوجد في %(name)s ما يُقدَّم: لا يملك أي من موظفيها قيدًا مسودة في "
"%(scope)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has nothing waiting for approval."
msgstr "لا يوجد في %(name)s ما ينتظر الاعتماد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s holds entries that have been handed to the General Manager, so its "
"component, month and department can no longer change."
msgstr ""
"تحتوي %(name)s على قيود سُلِّمت إلى المدير العام، فلا يمكن تغيير نوع مستحقها"
" أو شهرها أو قسمها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s holds entries the General Manager has or has approved, and cannot "
"be deleted."
msgstr "يحتوي %(name)s على قيود لدى المدير العام أو اعتمدها، ولا يمكن حذفه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "%(name)s is not approved, so there is nothing to reopen."
msgstr "%(name)s غير معتمدة، فلا يوجد ما يُعاد فتحه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_employee_rate.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is not paid as quantity × rate, so it has no unit rate to override."
" A salary-derived component already varies with the employee; a fixed amount"
" is typed on the entry itself."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s لا يدفع على أساس الكمية × السعر، لذا ليس له سعر وحدة لتجاوزه. "
"المكون المشتق من الراتب يختلف أصلا باختلاف الموظف؛ والمبلغ الثابت يكتب في "
"الإدخال نفسه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s is not yours to submit."
msgstr "%(name)s ليس من اختصاصك تقديمه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s is recorded per occurrence, so each entry needs a date."
msgstr "يُسجَّل %(name)s لكل واقعة، لذا يحتاج كل إدخال إلى تاريخ."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is with the General Manager. %(what)s is not possible until he "
"returns it."
msgstr "%(name)s لدى المدير العام. لا يمكن %(what)s حتى يعيدها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s needs a reason on every entry."
msgstr "يحتاج %(name)s إلى سبب في كل إدخال."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s needs the days it covers (From and To)."
msgstr "يلزم تحديد الأيام التي تغطيها %(name)s (من وإلى)."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s: more was deducted from his %(month)s commission than he earned in "
"it, so there is no accrual left to take it from."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s: خصم من عمولة %(month)s أكثر مما استحقه فيها، لذا لا يوجد استحقاق "
"متبق يخصم منه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s: trips imported again for its days."
msgstr "%(name)s: أُعيد استيراد الرحلات لأيامها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"%(names)s cannot be imported into %(batch)s — they are not under "
"%(department)s and do not report to you."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن استيراد %(names)s إلى %(batch)s — فهم ليسوا ضمن %(department)s ولا "
"يتبعونك."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(scope)s has already been handed to the General Manager as a whole — there "
"is nothing left to send early."
msgstr ""
"سُلِّم %(scope)s إلى المدير العام كاملًا — لم يعد هناك ما يُرسل مبكرًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(scope)s has already been submitted to the General Manager, so its batches "
"are frozen. Ask him to return it — or, if he has not looked yet, take the "
"submission back from the Monthly Pay Run."
msgstr ""
"سُلِّم %(scope)s بالفعل إلى المدير العام، لذا فدفعاته مجمّدة. اطلب منه "
"إعادته — أو اسحب التسليم من دورة المستحقات الشهرية إن لم يكن قد اطّلع بعد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(scope)s has been handed to the General Manager as a whole. %(what)s is not"
" possible until he returns it."
msgstr "سُلِّم %(scope)s إلى المدير العام كاملًا. لا يمكن %(what)s حتى يعيده."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/hr_payslip.py:0
msgid ""
"%(slip)s pays commission entries that have been paid since it was calculated:\n"
"%(rows)s\n"
"\n"
"Recompute the vacation payslip from the leave request before confirming it."
msgstr ""
"يصرف %(slip)s إدخالات عمولات صُرفت بعد احتسابه:\n"
"%(rows)s\n"
"\n"
"أعد احتساب كشف راتب الإجازة من طلب الإجازة قبل تأكيده."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/hr_payslip.py:0
msgid ""
"%(slip)s pays commission entries the General Manager has not approved:\n"
"%(rows)s\n"
"\n"
"Recompute the vacation payslip from the leave request before confirming it."
msgstr ""
"يصرف %(slip)s إدخالات عمولات لم يعتمدها المدير العام:\n"
"%(rows)s\n"
"\n"
"أعد احتساب كشف راتب الإجازة من طلب الإجازة قبل تأكيده."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "%(sub)s, %(days)s: "
msgstr "%(sub)s، %(days)s: "

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/wizard/ksw_pay_handover_wizards.py:0
msgid ""
"%(subs)s sent to the General Manager. Everything else in the month stays "
"open."
msgstr "أُرسلت %(subs)s إلى المدير العام. ويبقى كل ما عداها في الشهر مفتوحاً."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "%(what)s at the configured rate"
msgstr "%(what)s بالسعر المعد"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "%(what)s at this employee's own rate"
msgstr "%(what)s بالسعر الخاص بهذا الموظف"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(what)s is not possible: %(who)s went on vacation and what they had earned "
"was settled on the leave request. Delete those entries, or ask the General "
"Manager to release the month (Commissions → Vacation Releases)."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن %(what)s: %(who)s في إجازة وسُوّيت مستحقاتهم في طلب الإجازة. احذف "
"تلك القيود، أو اطلب من المدير العام إطلاق الشهر (العمولات ← إطلاقات "
"الإجازة)."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(who)s has no entry in %(scope)s, so there is nothing to hand over for "
"them."
msgstr "لا يوجد لـ %(who)s أي قيد في %(scope)s، فلا يوجد ما يُسلَّم عنهم."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_sub_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(who)s is already in %(other)s, which is still open. Add the rows there, or"
" wait until it is approved."
msgstr ""
"%(who)s موجود بالفعل في %(other)s التي ما زالت مفتوحة. أضف الأسطر هناك، أو "
"انتظر حتى تُعتمد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(name)s' derives its rate from the salary, so it needs a divisor (KSW uses"
" 240)."
msgstr ""
"يشتقّ «%(name)s» سعره من الراتب، لذا يحتاج إلى مقسوم عليه (وتعتمد KSW ٢٤٠)."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(name)s' has options, so its amount has to be a quantity × rate — each "
"option carries its own rate."
msgstr ""
"لمكوّن «%(name)s» خيارات، لذا يجب أن يكون مبلغه بطريقة الكمية × السعر — فكل "
"خيار يحمل سعره الخاص."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "'%(name)s' is recorded per department, so this batch needs one."
msgstr "يُسجَّل «%(name)s» لكل قسم، لذا تحتاج هذه الدفعة إلى قسم."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "'%(name)s' is recorded per work site, so this batch needs one."
msgstr "يُسجَّل «%(name)s» لكل موقع عمل، لذا تحتاج هذه الدفعة إلى موقع."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(name)s' is set to be filled by import only, so it needs an Import Source "
"— otherwise its batches can never be filled at all."
msgstr ""
"'%(name)s' معد ليملأ بالاستيراد فقط، لذا يحتاج إلى مصدر استيراد — وإلا فلن "
"يمكن ملء دفعاته إطلاقا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "'%(name)s' is tiered but has no rate tiers configured."
msgstr "«%(name)s» ذو شرائح لكن لم تُهيَّأ له أي شريحة سعر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_employee_rate.py:0
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid "'%(option)s' is not one of %(name)s's choices."
msgstr "«%(option)s» ليس من خيارات %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_employee_rate.py:0
msgid "'Valid To' comes before 'Valid From' on %(name)s."
msgstr "'صالح حتى' يسبق 'صالح من' في %(name)s."

