"The entry this row was copied from. Empty if it has since been deleted — the"
" row still says what was latched."
msgstr ""
"الإدخال الذي نسخ منه هذا الصف. يكون فارغا إذا حذف لاحقا — ويظل الصف يوضح ما "
"تم التقاطه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:KSW_commissions.field_ksw_pay_employee_rate__date_from
msgid ""
"The first month this rate applies to. Entries dated before it keep computing"
