"The journal-entry export is not available on this system yet: it is written "
"by KSW_payroll, which has not been updated. Ask IT to deploy it."
msgstr ""
"تصدير قيود اليومية غير متاح على هذا النظام بعد: يكتبه KSW_payroll، الذي لم "
